# Start your engines! and the speed it gives (CR 702.179): Perilous Snare entering on turn 1 gives Bot1 a speed of 1 as a
# state-based action (CR 704.5aa), before any ability goes on the stack. Each Lightning Bolt Bot1 points at Bot2 during
# Bot1's own turn triggers the inherent "whenever one or more opponents lose life during your turn, if your speed is less
# than 4, your speed increases by 1. This ability triggers only once each turn" (CR 702.179d), which uses the stack: on
# turn 1 to 2; on turn 2, Bot2's turn, a Bolt changes nothing; on turn 3 two Bolts raise it once, to 3; on turn 5 to 4,
# max speed; and on turn 7 a Bolt at max speed triggers nothing (the intervening "if", CR 603.4).

